{"id":"n15401-1-8","stage":2,"title":"무지개 · 彩虹","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15401-1-8-1","ko":"저기 보세요. 빌딩 사이로 무지개가 떴어요.","zh":"看那边，大楼之间出现了一道彩虹。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보세요","audio":"/audio/10b2f8c9f190884edd75.mp3"}},{"text":"빌딩","meaning":"大楼，高楼，大厦","explanation":"빌딩：大楼，高楼，大厦","readings":[{"term":"빌딩","audio":"/audio/ff6d98e9bec87ec095ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71069","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌딩","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌딩","audio":"/audio/ff6d98e9bec87ec095ab.mp3"}},{"text":"사이로","meaning":"间，之间，间距","explanation":"사이：间，之间，间距；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"1","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사이로","audio":"/audio/1a522d289c7c774d183c.mp3"}},{"text":"무지개가","meaning":"彩虹","explanation":"무지개：彩虹；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"무지개","audio":"/audio/1e821ffcefd0cae04600.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15401","senseId":"1","lemma":"무지개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무지개가","audio":"/audio/da5473fb3f0c6a8bcc4c.mp3"}},{"text":"떴어요.","meaning":"浮现、出现在空中（彩虹）","explanation":"뜨다：浮起、出现在空中；本句指彩虹出现；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66028","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떴어요","audio":"/audio/2c288e9b5fd314a47071.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ff6d98e9bec87ec0","term":"빌딩","zh":"大楼，高楼，大厦","audio":"/audio/ff6d98e9bec87ec095ab.mp3","entryId":"71069","definition":"主要作为办公场所使用的西式高层建筑物。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"间，之间，间距","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"从一个物体到另一个物体，或从一处到另一处的距离或空间。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"1e821ffcefd0cae0","term":"무지개","zh":"彩虹","audio":"/audio/1e821ffcefd0cae04600.mp3","entryId":"15401","definition":"雨停后，在太阳的对面天空呈现出的半圆形七彩色的光束。","pronunciation":["무지개"]},{"id":"83c29e672f4ac6fe","term":"뜨다","zh":"浮起、出现在空中；本句指彩虹出现","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3","entryId":"66028","definition":"浮起、出现在空中；本句指彩虹出现","pronunciation":["뜨다"]}],"audio":"/audio/901c0034fe0ca233ba30.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15401-1-8-2","ko":"정말이네! 무척 예뻐요.","zh":"真的啊！非常漂亮呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말이네!","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말이네","audio":"/audio/18a98d2dfae360cdec16.mp3"}},{"text":"무척","meaning":"非常，很","explanation":"무척：非常，很","readings":[{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55175","senseId":"1","lemma":"무척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}},{"text":"예뻐요.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예뻐요","audio":"/audio/a5623750987455866fae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"9d4e17cb57a7915a","term":"무척","zh":"非常，很","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3","entryId":"55175","definition":"程度深得别的无法与之相比。","pronunciation":["무척"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0b0cd02aaabfee4e765a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.538,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15401","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":62,"sequenceScore":1.3647,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真的啊！非常漂亮呢。","看那边，大楼之间出现了一道彩虹。","你认为这世上最可怕的东西是什么？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看那边，大楼之间出现了一道彩虹。","你认为这世上最可怕的东西是什么？","真的啊！非常漂亮呢。"],"answer":2}]}
